{"title": "Dwarven Armour Training", "pageid": 6585, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dwarven_Armour_Training", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp/300px-Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp, /w/images/1/1c/Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp/300px-Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Dwarven_Armour_Training.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Dwarven Armour Training</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf#Shield_Dwarves\" title=\"Dwarf\">Shield Dwarves</a> Proficiency with Light Armour and Medium Armour.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Armour Proficiency</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_light_armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_light_armour\" title=\"Armour\">Light armour</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_medium_armour\" title=\"Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_medium_armour\" title=\"Armour\">Medium armour</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Dwarf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield Dwarf\">Shield Dwarf</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200505\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 791/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5918/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2317/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nE